    "text": "MaxPreps\nwebsite\nNew Bremen\nVolleyball Recap: New Bremen Comes Up Short\nBy Team Reports,\n23 hours agoIf New Bremen was riding high fresh off their 3-0 takedown of Anna on Saturday, their most recent game may have dampened their spirits a bit. The Cardinals fell just short of the Parkway Panthers by a score of 3-2 on Tuesday. The Cardinals were given a dose of their own medicine in this game as the Panthers apparently hadn't forgotten their loss the last time these teams played back in September of 2024.",
